  "description": "Motorcycle-grade power, off-road-focused geometry, and practical electric performance built into one aggressive ride.\n\nThe digital display shows real-time riding data, making it easy to track speed, power, and ride status at a glance.\n\nA bright front headlight with integrated turn signals improves visibility and helps riders stay more noticeable on the road.\n\nRear brake light and turn signals help communicate every stop and turn, adding confidence during city rides and night travel.\n\nA large-capacity battery, strong motor system, and suspension support work together to deliver confident performance across mixed terrain.\n\nA 2500W brushless gearless hub motor delivers up to 6000W peak power and approximately 45 MPH when unlocked. Factory speed is set to 20 MPH.\n\nLarge 220 mm front and 203 mm rear rotors deliver strong, responsive braking and reliable control in a wide range of riding conditions.\n\nSmooth, controlled acceleration with a comfortable half-twist design for easy power adjustment.\n\nBright built-in lights with integrated left and right turn signals for better visibility and safer riding.\n\nFull-color display with USB charging, memory function, and convenient NFC keyless startup.\n\nPuncture-resistant fat tires on both front and rear wheels for added traction, stability, and durability.\n\nBright brake light activates when braking, with dual flowing turn signals for clear left and right indication.\n\nLong-range 60V 45Ah battery with a removable design for convenient charging and storage.\n\nThe spacious, cushioned long seat provides enhanced support and comfort for relaxed daily rides and longer journeys.",
